<title>GREECE: OFFICIAL BANK HOLIDAYS IN 1997 - UNION OF HELLENIC BANKS.</title>
<headline>OFFICIAL BANK HOLIDAYS IN 1997 - UNION OF HELLENIC BANKS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union of Hellenic Banks</p>
<p>released the list of official bank holidays for the coming year.</p>
<p>Banks will be closed for 12 days in 1997, as follows:</p>
<p>    January  1    Wednesday   New Years</p>
<p>    January  6    Monday	Epiphany</p>
<p>    March    10   Monday	Shrove Monday</p>
<p>    March    25   Tuesday     Independence Day</p>
<p>    April    25   Friday	Good Friday</p>
<p>    April    28   Monday	Easter Monday</p>
<p>    May	1    Thursday    May Day</p>
<p>    June     16   Monday	Holy Ghost Day</p>
<p>    August   15   Friday	Assumption of the Virgin</p>
<p>    October  28   Tuesday     National &quot;OXI&quot; Day</p>
<p>    December 25   Thursday    Christmas Day</p>
<p>    December 26   Friday	Boxing Day</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
